657.description:
Dry blasting cleaning machines are free-standing, requiring no special foundations and extremely compact for today's growing market.
They are ideally suited to cleaning components which can be tumble-blasted using steel shot to remove rust, scale and paint removal.
A great example is automotive components, particularly in the reconditioning of brake shoes and turbo chargers.
 
The 220 model is fitted with a thermal cut out device and single or three phase electricity supply can be included.
 
√ Powder coated finish;
√ Single phase electrics;
√ Single blast wheel;
√ Heavy duty barrel 50mm x 25mm mesh;
√ Internal rubber protection;
√ Gas assisted hood;
√ Integral dust extraction;
